{title: Dum Maro Dum}
{artist: Asha Bhosle R D Burman}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am]dum maro dum,        [Am]mit jaye gum
[G]bolo subah shaam,        hare [F]krishna [Am]hare ram
hare [Am]krishna hare ram,        hare [Am]krishna hare ram
[Am]duniyaa ne hum ko [G]diya kya,        [G]duniyaa se hum ne [F]liya kya
[F]hum sab ki parwa [E]kare kyon,        [E]sab ne humara [Am]kiya kya
[Am]Aa [G]Aa [F]Aa [E]Aa,        [Am]chahe jiyenge ma [G]renge
[G]ham na kisi se da [F]renge,        [F]ham ko na roke za [E]mana
[E]jo chahe woh hum [Am]karenge,        [Am]Aa [G]Aa [F]Aa [E]Aa
[Am]dum maro dum,        [Am]mit jaye gum
[G]bolo subah shaam,        hare [F]krishna [Am]hare ram
hare [Am]krishna hare ram,        hare [Am]krishna hare ram
